Now CSS for the workflow page/cards/editor. Add a new style block after the last `</style>` (the v6 page refinements). Include:
- `.workflow-list`, `.wf-card`, head, switch, route, steps, meta, actions.
- `.wf-editor-scrim`, `.wf-editor`, head/body/foot, fields, step editor, add row.
- responsive.
- The `.drawer-close` exists in the previous style (v6 page refinements); yes. The editor uses it.
- The `.empty-state` existing; the workflowEmpty is outside the list; hidden.
- The stats.
- The page.
- The workflow card.

Let's design CSS carefully.

```css
.workflow-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.wf-card{
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:2px solid var(--green);
  border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);padding:16px 16px 14px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);
  transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s;
}
.wf-card.is-draft{border-left-color:var(--amber)}
.wf-card:hover{border-color:var(--ink-3);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md)}
.wf-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}
.wf-mark{width:30;height:30;border:1px solid line;border-radius:6;display:grid;place-items:center;background:surface-2;color:prussian;flex:none}
.wf-mark .ic{width:15;height:15}
.wf-title-wrap{flex:1;min-width:0}
.wf-name{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6;font-size:14;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.wf-name .tag{font-size:8.5;padding:1px 4}
.wf-desc{margin-top:3px;font-size:11.5;line-height:1.6;color:ink-3;max-width:72ch}
.wf-state{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6;flex:none;padding-top:2px}
.wf-state-text{font-size:9.5;color:ink-3}
.wf-switch{width:28;height:16;border:1px solid line;border-radius:9;background:line-2;position:relative;flex:none;transition}
.wf-switch span{position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:10;height:10;border-radius:50%;background:surface;transition:transform .15s;box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgba}
.wf-switch.is-on{background:prussian;border-color:prussian}
.wf-switch.is-on span{transform:translateX(12px)}
.wf-route{margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid line-2}
.wf-route-label{font-size:9;color:ink-3;margin-bottom:6px}
.wf-steps{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}
.wf-step{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:26;padding:0 7;border:1px solid line-2;border-left:2px solid line;border-radius:4;background:surface-2;font-size:10.5;color:ink-2;white-space:nowrap}
.wf-step-num{font-family:mono;font-size:8;color:ink-3}
.wf-step-type{font-size:8;color:ink-3}
.wf-step-name{font-size:10;color:ink-2}
.wf-link{width:12;height:1;background:line;flex:none}
/* type colors */
.wf-step.step-skill{border-left-color:green}.wf-step.step-skill .wf-step-type{color:green}
.wf-step.step-vector{border-left-color:prussian}...
